  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added: The interfaces describe themselves completely, so that the records can be written from them: every interface has the ISO name of its type (`IsoDisplayName`), the 316 interfaces of obsolete types are marked `Obsolete`, every member that may repeat says which kind of list holds its items (`IsoList`, 20,961 members), and the members that carry the facets of their type have them (`IsoSimpleType`, `StringLength`, `MinLength`, `MaxLength`; 57,839 members). Nothing existing changes, so this is a compatible change.\nChanged: The package depends on `BeneficialStrategies.Iso20022.Primitives` 1.0.1-alpha or later (for the two attributes), and on `System.ComponentModel.Annotations` for netstandard2.0.",
